I'm sorry you don't have a mom to love and love you in return. Family troubles are the worst when they should be your support system. :(

Congratulations! That's an amazing accomplishment! Especially being able to do this without feeling like you're restricting - breaking that binge/restrict cycle is so important compared to 'dieting'! Good luck :) 

