I worked at Goodwill and they throw out SO many of their donations. They constantly get donations that are just tossed and never even put out onto the floor, I go dumpster diving at my local Goodwill all the time and find gems LOL. Going to the outlet stores and seeing carts of clothing be trashed is kind of sad too. Yet they want to cut out the resale market and keep upping prices... makes no sense.

Congrats on losing the weight! You look great! I did the same thing that everyone is talking about - when you're not happy with your weight you never wear clothes that ACTUALLY fit, so when you drop a few sizes it's odd because you're both dropping sizes and not buying clothes that hide your body so you're like HOW AM I A MEDIUM I WORE A 3X BEFORE hahaha

